 In contrast to an explosive,
 bullet cavitation fluid dynamics works in opposite manner with respect to energy expansion to an explosion.
 The bullet cavitation forms a vacuum from the bullet ass end as it moves through air.
 A bullet compresses air in the front and creates a void behind it that air rushes into fill.
 
\end_layout

